<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia's Mercator 1995 net profit surges.</title>
<headline>Slovenia's Mercator 1995 net profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian trading company Mercator said on Monday its 1995 net profit soared to 415.7 million tolars ($3 million) from 7.3 million in 1994.</p>
<p>Turnover rose to 3.3 billion tolars from 2.9 billion tolars in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company said it managed an improvement in earnings after a particularly tough 1994. -- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
